278
00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:45.290
Yeah.

279
00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:46.730
But it made me cry.

280
00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:48.210
I teared up at that scene.

281
00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.470
I thought it was so beautiful.

282
00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:53.630
Well, I have a fun little personal tidbit about this episode.

283
00:12:54.950 --> 00:13:01.490
