291
00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:38.510
So it really points to, like, if you back up the dates, not only did Pam and Jim get it

292
00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:40.910
on, but this is the episode they conceived Philip.

293
00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:41.630
Wow.

294
00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:44.710
But you did not conceive during the week of shooting.

295
00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.270
You were already pregnant.

296
00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.050
Oh my gosh.

297
00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.630
I know where I conceived.

298
00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:50.290
I'll keep that to myself.

299
00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:53.570
But it was over the Christmas hiatus.

300
00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:54.490
Yeah, that makes more sense.

301
00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:55.750
So we were not shooting.

302
00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:59.010
No, but there must have been something was happening, right?

303
00:13:59.190 --> 00:13:59.410
Yeah.

304
00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.910
Because we shot this when we got back from break.

305
00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:06.510
Well, now I want to watch it again and just picture the idea that your baby is directing

