00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:27.950
She goes to another school.

337
00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:29.530
Oh, that was so good.

338
00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:36.250
And I think that probably that was so good that that dampened every other possibility for

