00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:03.530
He's always too early, too soon.

366
00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:03.850
Yeah.

367
00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.970
And you're just like, oh, he's blowing it.

368
00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:06.810
He's blowing it.

369
00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:09.050
And then he didn't blow it because she felt the same way.

370
00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.790
And that was such a good moment.

371
00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:12.850
I loved it.

372
00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:19.010
And I loved the reaction shots while the scene was happening because Jim has this look like,

