00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:24.770
Because it read drunk, but also like, oh, my God.

375
00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:30.370
But then Pam has this look that reads drunk, Jenna, but it's like, oh, no, oh, no, mayday,

376
00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:31.330
