377
00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:32.650
Like, no, Michael.

378
00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:34.850
And it just helped it build.

379
00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:37.210
And then she was right there where he was.

380
00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:38.230
And it was so perfect.

