00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:36.020
I sold a show with Robert after The Office.

455
00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:37.100
I remember that.

456
00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:42.040
Jenna, I went to my digital clutter because I was like, oh, do I have a synopsis or a log

457
00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.140
line about our show?

458
00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:44.280
And I found it.

459
00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:45.260
Oh, sure.

460
00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:47.020
Robert and I pitched this show.

461
00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:48.440
It did not end up getting made.

462
00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:51.100
It was briefly bought, but then didn't get made.

463
00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.100
And here's the log line.

464
00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:58.240
A family in which everyone is single and overly involved in each other's lives.

465
00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:04.320
Angela is trying to manage a house full of misfits while they all try to manage her dating

466
00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:04.760
career.

467
00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:10.760
Angela's unique blend of mothering instincts plus total naivete when it comes to dating gets

468
00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:13.700
her into compromising situations with the guys she meets.

469
00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:19.000
Angela works with her best friend, Jenna, whose own family serves as a counterpoint to Angela's.

470
00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:23.240
And she lives vicariously through Angela's dating misadventures.

471
00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:29.040
Well, I want everybody to know how very hard it is to sell a show.

472
00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:30.220
That is not easy.

473
00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:36.000
I know this show didn't get made, but the fact that you have sold your shows that you've

474
00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:36.480
pitched.

475
00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:37.060
Yes.

476
00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.960
When you go out to pitch, Angela sells.

477
00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:41.480
She's a great writer, great creator.

478
00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:42.620
Aw, thanks.

479
00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:44.580
I actually had a lot of fun rereading it.

